  "releaseNotes": "Targets net8.0/net9.0/net10.0. Hardened identifier handling against SQL injection, added async CRUD methods + cancellation tokens, IAsyncEnumerable streaming, SqlBulkCopy, FormattableString parameterized API, ILogger integration, [Column]/[Table]/[Key] attributes, expanded type coercion (DateOnly/TimeOnly/Guid/enum), Source Link + symbols. BREAKING: dropped netcoreapp3.1/net5.0; GetModelById returns T?; dynamic id -> object.",
